{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1399,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:672a0bf606b1f70b3c6ed086",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f7d54a5c2185062f6a07c1ddef2c8437efb599f859fa33aec5893fb97c30e9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0028bc41b62302df98dffa64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0615f35f7b967cbbbef5e5223e75fb6a03b988771d4067f785cebb30ecf787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dddfdc01e06ba12d508c767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce3212b06e87bf6a87af73d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2045e127d0da20c28f97190f1b0e56261012feb7b72882c5eebf86f9e6bf0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9387362bb2812be5359bfa71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a6cbc3dbb12c098c30355bb7c6e811e7efa371a964aa64771c972a5f15a308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04fae3c9ed4be031cdcc906c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，明天好像会收到这些耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b132e76321ddbd08ff3f696adaefc363ca41751c32515bac555c17a53336dcea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb498fce82b6772ee362ee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……使不上力气……\r\n我的优点\r\n明明是身体强壮才对啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e819c23f66b81b84a7ef237544338b083bdf411462e34295b1c47d3c409c8a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c748d11b9d9a156746d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇……奇怪？\r\n好像有点……晕晕的……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "778f06d148e51b4fc9add427f527d324f86aee998ec1bcf6b12ce499038f3e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad9dceec5c134fc92dceeb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看我这干劲！\r\n随时都可以开始。\r\n嘿呀！喝啊！嘿呀！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1668122fb47ab8685e0463eb47d41e441502077e6f9249a35c5a039f0292db87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a480d8a29c07f11d0424a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算训练负担比平常更重\r\n我也没问题！\r\n总觉得双脚很轻盈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f67d674614733f7a4c05b879b6a6d48ee5fce84722fb50aeacaa13cd3f474255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d1c9cc27f33dc7d0677a96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么训练项目\r\n全都可以！来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d6ca185bfb14b819702889cb9898067ecf095609bf8411346cb13a91685e05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f237a4b78ad1234e24c96d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长一点一滴努力！\r\n我要加油，\r\n获得只属于我的武器！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8507c5c9127df48eac63b5929a098a5cffc002eb8595ff4f8a4759ea033053f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc1a8888fc4d369b65568b5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况没有问题！\r\n今天也请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7f38a8d4c9af029213b1d3102920989859473ed8c3d268c4e6e627d55bb5f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba8a2564d5f0b5c36550eb4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，为了迎接\r\n名为比赛日的大日子，\r\n今天打算做什么训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "512b341ad21f41f5def609ee90054a3ae7bdbbc76f4c28af0ae5fb46a737d242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6688d8265705659b8542b242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～怎么会这样？\r\n全身就像湿掉的烟火一样……\r\n使不出力气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eddfd88f196f512c6337b2ff2972de8d376f1662a9dba7c7b9f22eba93e50549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae67c5669b5925379ac3a43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～啊，对不起！\r\n今天总觉得……\r\n体内的力气好像都漏光了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "98679c722edcb4a0e9448050e785d8caf721dd5a52b58d2096ca81d2e9926321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c7eecd2a724681f7f514344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜，为什么使不上力气啊！？\r\n明明爸爸跟大家都在\r\n为我拼命加油的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a2e5a1a3d6e19c4ebaef6bb47ff918b4fa6bb57f2e960b6d33b0e6bc51b503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ade33f5e4f7e456d1450b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么办……我不想\r\n在这种地方停滞不前啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "428fa851121f78c6b3fbe6b85785f49e8be8266290af56e29345c67eb792b2e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0609428f4aadff1f66e8b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？又要比赛啊！？\r\n虽然身体强壮的确是我的优点啦……\r\n真、真的没问题吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9e2d82236bf90d93a29f00f47d77a854f15af358b168d21fdc8a1a50d6a7c92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a038465b86d7b7e332c1f376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近是不是连续参赛过头了……？\r\n要是连自己都没有精神，\r\n是无法让别人打起精神的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31daa75630709079738ccf9cb3f1d40f7dad2955cad375bc49a5c0f70ae5902e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7221a963a02c3c1d6f94069b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了迎战今日强敌，我不惜每日\r\n冲刺锻炼。来吧，一决胜负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9ea710b59d6abc388e18ce71319a8e061297a2d22e535604df6a1ce088200c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd88f0c02154541e45d2375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用领头夺取众人目光的祭典女孩！\r\n在场各位敬请见证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde77ad3d891fc652eb0c263471ddf9464e03c5bd4d6cd2163b62c508abfeffd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5111877f61290671cdd7dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊～～啊！！！\r\n很～好，喉咙与身体都状态绝佳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a5fc1e2c32c2558a8ea39e9d3808bb3cd6caa6fbca7b2d54d5a58e539ed436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab9b9494a01968dd3dc150fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身上可是背负着\r\n大家的声援！\r\n我绝对不会让其他人追过我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21babbb0e32cc2a2e6c289ecf09c30bd7afff458a4555d558ded085b66e7f9b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:581f96356defd39ba28678ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了这一天\r\n你一直陪着我努力锻炼！\r\n我会回报这份恩情的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f3eb7d3fa0eb9c18c8118faa70dac85b80cbeb9f91a76428779d4d4158e5eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d746065985412c0461b22dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家看见，连爸妈\r\n都为之感到骄傲的出色背影！",
      "source_fingerprint": "268f46ac269c3c9c00c48eeb222018383d1699448cc644acc9bb3067c8b0c544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f898738f02aabd608756a91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天出门时朋友用打火石为我送行！\r\n好兆头也讨到了，接着我可要\r\n气势高昂地出发啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4faee43ee4de7032de51a9f6759b68100d116d306eedd82ae562458aff325b43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ef78125ca700c456896a04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻，嘿呵！\r\n……好，状态算是普通。\r\n我这就去彻底发挥出至今的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "457493566dfd4fb4462fc3af95be9aad75d094bcd7aa7042d0cb2adb79c4b3c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f210af0c1dea3932892036",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸也常说，保持跟平常一样\r\n就是最棒的。\r\n我要用平常心挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "425407932ee002cd64a832982214a7acd3d8ce128c5c74ce76e815d1d0c91011",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320e9d4f7c686771cebc1048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早我好像梦到拉神轿的绳子\r\n断掉了……呜呜，\r\n得要赶快调适心情才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c74606f8a8303e05b4aa4af349b31ffe8541de82ff2ccdb126855ab4ebadc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25df79557f1b7a89a51bd459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问，我可以去找个地方\r\n尽情吶喊吗！？我想发泄\r\n胸口的这股烦闷……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d131d27226bca312d90daafb9d89f78e76619169214506fa56495d104584e5b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2baf322265c2c76fc7d8013a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还有些不安……但这可是正式\r\n比赛了。只要相信至今为止的努力\r\n下场去跑就没问题……对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44c6bb712587329c9aae2aa72c3e9fe61c8447592998e9ed35c2b25229fdf99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:763c719b41f91c50f40badc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人生并不是只有美好的时光，\r\n歌词也是这么写的……\r\n我会尽自己所能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e788a7720ea260df2bc4dfff450257017f0c40aec5f46d5bf1363147ff2e47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d2b591d477f4dd4baa7aa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心情消沉……\r\n彷佛烛火快要熄灭的灯笼……\r\n我、我会尽力跑到最后一刻的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a35d491cf95f5b1794f8383b663e39f1a0030e3f09c5a9d5a56317c7ce68632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6a687abccf99ee45506a40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老实说我状况不太好。不过我认为\r\n不能还没跑就先输在心情上……\r\n所以我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb07f021970c4524af08da2598048012c076298e13a3cf4a4ad21cc2ac01f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b8a71cb6f2c5cd3897f49b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿呀──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "580b83783e1315b9253d8385b681f48b101fafb7f6faba9cd6fe8e094feefac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b9ea7f30273ca6083a7f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95345e686a2624db3212f49b882d52b89822b2acf5f23012304ac01721ec5930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a88a239a87d22dc965a704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿出气势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ee9b0fa3bb0e432b3ba0c4d21d21c57d375b739c2c0a78fa891801a4dea622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d3da34faf1a79861ee8321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "专心、专心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d06d12e0554afecba5b21c3300daff145cc35cc0c678221af6c3fed200f2ad0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1540959443c3eb8b64af9086",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会吧～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd7c4d1cc71cf93a16ed21d9cc4706008df27471e2a0797665a4b13aed089c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a02e8b081dd3c3d8ddbf167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇、奇怪～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "addfc9bf255d17ca06935d424e1fd0c589d8eca6955c94091324b11fee2b10d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916bc4b184f3dd2bec149bd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7fc63ef7473c5f28df6584a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一路赛跑到海边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0814eeb66c73308d63fef478910b89f6ddabe4e36a03d36c27566d9cdb5fd917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5e286df31695fca4e20eb62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有让你露出笑容了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f015aee019d86f060d49c8bd17f09ebabbfe0dfd36bf8708247988b287e819e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5fd0b8d2bd891dae0c99ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a0d3053061f77d918d4d25ca704cb16a7d195cd4edb3c8dc9cccfb75dfaf21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b6efb008184f1582e71eaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们鼓起干劲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8bdcaea6f0fdfb0f129ea9990ac6e5c40c45bb80c3e89b188f9917ef81acbea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89746ea6d16a78d7874df9fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛就是祭典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1041ceeffb66463507282725f8c0e80850ef0bfefb6ab2a02d2620499caff603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:306fb0dcc247f35d9ec5279c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满气势地前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab9d2f93e36d770b5ea897477abbbba0133088c08ba9ff529c239b5e825102c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4712f5fdc0156f126973354e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a0d3053061f77d918d4d25ca704cb16a7d195cd4edb3c8dc9cccfb75dfaf21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c99bc8b0bac75c5a86cd162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家看到我出色的背影，\r\n让爸爸妈妈为我感到骄傲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58bb70b837a6d71e0860ffacba8cd07d8131a63f746bdeb771d45561819bebac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2175416e9115919b736b862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊～～啊！！！\r\n很～好，喉咙与身体都状态绝佳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a5fc1e2c32c2558a8ea39e9d3808bb3cd6caa6fbca7b2d54d5a58e539ed436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183648a5aa44b3e0873948b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a0d3053061f77d918d4d25ca704cb16a7d195cd4edb3c8dc9cccfb75dfaf21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bce4967e0184f9c784bd62b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "セイヤーーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa564b1586ed7bfc4ef3aa91110b59e8df89169665e7df873f382f99b10fb30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19f745dedee00da780b4333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜～！\r\n但这是能让我自豪的成果了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bdcece04949aba0ac88de11adc15249e3e760b78aada785137d6988802fec96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c7e84da9e1f3ccfe3b82af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要将胜利的烟火射上天空！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21710ed2c70e9cf9196dfce9cd8d1239b8ef323887e23d2497a256cc2dbf7d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee3f5772a5ee7ee6b7ce9eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以自己的方式好好努力过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d7b2d20b330f60080bb8f26e130daf10cbeb3c00a4978d62ff4913e2bb15d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b236bf6a4a23e81dcb253e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得将这份不甘化作动力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5baf53fdf8e76711de12c135f10abc47673013c7985e783bfc83db9ab763be02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e9660b43ba5406983d4f4be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要唱出感谢之意！呃、还没啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "859c88606e65d60f4955b7715af1f5b569a6372e536308f0923fe8d365ce2bda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8ecdcf27a5a8853f070d1d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天要用这双脚带给大家勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa7f618c15706abc97c800fdba2439596a0b3a75d8e7bfa9011bb446432bdb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ef64f82631c703aa5fb640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的灯火，会照亮所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a3d16fd5bc5829c7dd7cb9bf073185d42e462fd4d93f7f7f574d0adcfd77cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e594733480f9f7c35ec9551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天要用这双脚带给大家勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa7f618c15706abc97c800fdba2439596a0b3a75d8e7bfa9011bb446432bdb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68b9898c818969ec2e0a3761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしがお祭りにしてみせます\r\n…何度だって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "281504b039f71134fb895ae7ebc85ef6c139c6cbae4dc188b0b9d765baf0fdb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2473377f45581920f2593afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつかこの脚で、みんなに勇気を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9801c3850f3b4a5b717d8f8596048edde3a1132a1f635b5b9f6449565a372ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c1c3266be7d690cac9a7d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要继续炒热气氛啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "378222d4381ff95209faad78772dd372e336935d367224e60a0c23edab5f9f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bebfdacce812f92239cbe0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿呀喝啊，嘿呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d257befbc65b89c708366fc9562c1b0503ce53185f32ce6849504338d2e03aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0e836e2863f36db9ddf8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～还剩两个人……不快点决定的话\r\n就要赶不上报名期限了……\r\n得找小钻商量才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a8f7bcd4a353f377a0e1ece4a938c13c943acc8b4fb46909114110b2daaaa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abd24c230afd1d9c6a40b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园……\r\n一点也不普通！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8244abc35eea758ce3143b5c4573c4f62eadee0247d82734b27d609e70d69eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6fa0dd7d49a1987e2bbe299",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才刚入学就遇到接二连三的麻烦！\r\n不过，有朋友在一起\r\n就尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "233a625044969ebd880f547eac0417e06a771d2e039c13153ad0db52c79e2ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ffd1b30af742dc66e5ffa08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好多难缠的对手……！\r\n呜呜，要不要紧呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2682d48009ee9bb5ce4b698eb9a5269f2e218346e976620a5bc0a88aa6b3fd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565726a9ce7834a375639c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王，请你等我吧。\r\n我绝对会在这所学园……\r\n变强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74531796990815825efb71d2a9b65d3cc0a563d01a3ac8a6c8782959a362db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340908466d74294f9960a36e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "久等了，祭典女孩登场！\r\n容我先冲一步了，嘿呀嘿呀！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2718a169fe23772de393a576285bdfe66efca7f8f9b151094e74e6035e673c9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82bbb427226692c0a3767c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年もよろしくお願いします！\r\n1つの祭りが終わっても、まだまだ\r\nいっぱい祭りを起こしますから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa1f59799018edd401ca9b83528d3dd16eeca68c69808093ac4b4a0015396cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b6a65fec1308b7a6b1fbf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后的路想必相当艰辛。\r\n不过……有朋友在一起\r\n就尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5cda7473d87c6fa5ebf910919c3af40130774d96a39413e03d7bf9848f0b55a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc6b1d7574cce8e09db31ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～活动结束了……\r\n不过之后就更让人期待了。\r\n因为有崭新的日子在等着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb57836c15aec66ea59758b174fddcfd3d58408b5dd71594857998ff3e1fe74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3a5545a3ea4c78cfbeabf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场大赛让我学到了很多事！\r\n我会铭记在心，\r\n持续奔跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3052ec9baa4bfa5bcdc6a70d33076d04a94d026fcc1206522ef1425db95c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a4822e053260fd9823baae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了！\r\n大赛真是太开心了～！\r\n我还想继续跟大家一起跑呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a18da55f094d9960ce3e48475933dcd57aac37b8802502f3274a208a90fe21a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1becfa89063f5ea93e7714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家获得幸福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "048c77ffdf8b7d34f5a5da69b535f4555ceb6056c77503db4090f41ec74c21db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93380ed92f4b037424b97645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然年底非常忙碌，\r\n但我是大家的助人大将！\r\n我会努力执行「神社复活计划」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0bdc72f2c1b6dd72edd3f4283f91d7588d2e02b2f2918af019f80d2d56b92a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368d08cde5db8b9a2e6261bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘巫女参拜，终于开始了！\r\n只要和小钻一起，\r\n就一定能成功……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e320f29e89fb20d6ac1e9ed8b9f03167ba7e0cfb4c3245f21c098319afc0b5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "400038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e9ce919e83752c5323ead2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来祈祷大家能够幸福吧～！\r\n无病无灾！新春万福！新年快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2f3cd2c9ce582edaa42bdb3d2e490b36f072249aa01d69b5451d8dab5d4284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "40004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
